flowchart TD
  Input["Pointer / keyboard / host action"] --> Map["Map to logical action and active record path"]
  Map --> Core["Validate and compute in authoritative core"]
  Core --> Valid{"Action valid?"}
  Valid -->|"no"| Reject["Structured reason; active state unchanged"]
  Valid -->|"yes"| Commit["Apply record / cursor transition"]
  Commit --> Snapshot["Publish authoritative snapshot and record update"]
  Snapshot --> View["Render board, controls and comments"]
